    <meta name="description" content="Home of the Saints | LBW Community College provides affordable academic, technical, and workforce programs with multiple class formats and flexible scheduling at 4 campuses.  The College offers dual enrollment, technical training, 2-to-4- year transfer, adult education, and community education that prepares students for Alabama’s growing workforce.
